ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-agent-name = Neo-Eclipse Agent
ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-agent-description = You are an elite Agent of Neo-Eclipse, a radical splinter that follows Harbinger's old doctrine. Follow the Overseer's directive and eradicate assigned anomalies and artifacts regardless of collateral damage.

ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-operative-name = Neo-Eclipse Operative
ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-operative-description = You are an Operative of Neo-Eclipse. Follow your Handler's orders, secure the operation and complete the eradication directive at any cost.

ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-enforcer-name = Neo-Eclipse Enforcer
ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-enforcer-description = You are an Enforcer of Neo-Eclipse. Maintain order, protect Neo-Eclipse assets and eliminate anything that threatens the directive.

ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-initiate-name = Neo-Eclipse Initiate
ghost-role-information-neo-eclipse-initiate-description = You are a new recruit to Neo-Eclipse. Support the operation, obey your superiors and prove your devotion to Harbinger's doctrine.
